  "headBody": "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><title>Issue 42: The slow web</title>\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Dana Ruiz\"></head><body>\n<table class=\"email-wrapper\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td align=\"center\">\n<table class=\"email-body\" width=\"600\"><tr><td class=\"header\"><h1>Issue 42: The slow web</h1></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"content\"><p>Hello friends,</p><p>This week: why I stopped refreshing, three essays worth your evening, and a recipe for slow bread.</p>\n<h2>1. Stop refreshing</h2><p>The best interface to the news is a printed page that arrives once a day. I tried it for a month.</p>\n<h2>2. Three essays</h2><ul><li><a href=\"https://example.org/a\">On boredom</a></li><li><a href=\"https://example.org/b\">On maps</a></li><li><a href=\"https://example.org/c\">On waiting</a></li></ul>\n<p>Until next week,<br>Dana</p></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"footer\"><p><a href=\"https://letters.example.com/unsubscribe?id=1\">Unsubscribe</a> | <a href=\"https://letters.example.com/prefs\">Preferences</a></p></td></tr></table>\n</td></tr></table></body></html>\n"
}
